      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PANTHER'S WAY (8) missed the frame latest when sixth at this track (30.60) but scored five back at Traralgon (24.11). Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Rates on top in this line up. MORE THAN WORDS (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split and ran away with a 2.5 lengths win at Shepparton over 450m in 25.54. The form out of last race has been strong. Deserves serious consideration again. TALK THAT TALK (6) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.1 lengths away in third (26.42) behind Dr. Ulma at Warragul. Expected to feature. PRINCESS LASS (4) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
